## Meta-Note

This evidence package was compiled by the `evidence-compiler` agent as part of the article publication pipeline. The compiler itself is a Haiku-based agent that:
1. Finds all verification reports (uses latest versions)
2. Extracts quoted sources and verifies line numbers via grep
3. Copies agent definitions used in verification
4. Generates this README with GitHub URLs
5. Commits the complete evidence package to git

The evidence-compiler definition is also available in the source repository at `.claude/agents/evidence-compiler.md`.

