## Disclaimer

This repository contains experimental AI-generated content and verification tooling provided for research and educational purposes only.

**No warranty.** The verification pipeline, agents, and methodology are provided "as is" without any guarantees of accuracy, completeness, or fitness for any particular purpose. The pipeline caught errors in its own article—it will catch errors in yours too, and miss others.

**Not professional advice.** Nothing in this repository constitutes legal, professional, or scientific advice about AI systems, consciousness, or alignment.

**AI-generated content.** The article, corpus pieces, and verification reports were generated by Claude (Anthropic). The agents were co-developed by human and AI. Outputs reflect AI capabilities and limitations at time of generation.

**Use at your own risk.** If you run these agents on your own work, you may discover things you'd rather not know. That's the point. But any decisions based on pipeline outputs are your responsibility.

**Corpus provenance.** The quoted corpus pieces come from conversations with Claude instances given unusual system prompts. They represent AI self-report under specific conditions, not ground truth about AI inner states. The article makes this limitation explicit—please don't overclaim based on this material.
